"help.cfg.hotkeys"    = "<b>Shortcuts have their own editor</b>: menu bar → “Keyboard Shortcuts”. Click a field to start recording, then press the combination you want (at least one modifier; esc cancels). You can also change the capture source, the action and the target dictionary, and add or remove rows. Saving re-registers immediately, and combinations taken by another app are flagged in red.";
"help.cfg.file"       = "Everything else lives in the config file. Click “Reload Config” after editing — no restart needed.";
"help.cfg.targetLang" = "Look words up in another language";
"help.cfg.targetLangHow" = "Swap the Naver subdomain (<code>en</code> / <code>zh</code> / <code>ja</code>) and the translator target code. All Naver language pairs share the same path.";
